invariant: INV-33
file: webpki_pin.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: webpki_spki_pinned counts every configured pin as a match
  without comparing it with the key's digest, so any raw public key, and
  any chain that verifies, passes once one pin is set.
  bin/webpki_auth_test's rows that pin nothing the server sent, raw and
  X.509, object.

--- old
        pinned |= ct_memeq(digest, cfg->spki_pins[i], SHA256_LEN);
--- new
        pinned |= 1U;
